---
---
<section class="bg-[oklch(0.95_0.018_85)] border-y border-border/60">
<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
<div class="order-2 md:order-1">
<div class="tracking-luxury text-xs text-gold-dark mb-4">YOUR STORY · THE JOURNEY</div>
<h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-6">Twelve decks. One shared journey.</h2>
<div class="space-y-6">
<div class="flex gap-4">
<div class="shrink-0 h-11 w-11 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center bg-[oklch(0.35_0.015_60)] text-cream">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z">
</path>
<path d="M20 2v4">
</path>
<path d="M22 4h-4">
</path>
<circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2">
</circle>
</svg>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="font-display text-xl">12+ Curated Decks</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm mt-1">From Icebreakers and Spontaneous, to Beliefs, Marriage, Healing and DealBreakers.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex gap-4">
<div class="shrink-0 h-11 w-11 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center bg-[oklch(0.35_0.015_60)] text-cream">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-heart h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5">
</path>
</svg>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="font-display text-xl">Shared Memory Diary</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm mt-1">Log the day you met, the exact hour, how you felt after each date — laugh about it in five years.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex gap-4">
<div class="shrink-0 h-11 w-11 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center bg-[oklch(0.35_0.015_60)] text-cream">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5">
</path>
</svg>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="font-display text-xl">Relationship Action Tasks</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm mt-1">Weekly rituals designed to keep your bond growing long after the wedding.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-10">
<a href="#download" class="btn-gold btn-gold-hover inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-8 py-4 text-sm tracking-luxury uppercase ">Seek true Alignment</a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="order-1 md:order-2 flex justify-center">
<div class="relative">
<div class="absolute -inset-6 rounded-[3rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-[oklch(0.9_0.06_85_/_0.5)] to-transparent blur-2xl">
</div>
<img src="/images/qq-journey.png" alt="QalbQuest app showing 12 relationship decks" class="relative w-[320px] rounded-[2.5rem] card-luxury"/>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
